@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
autonumber
control "POST /chat" as Route
control "RAG pipeline" as RAG
control "Configured retriever" as Retriever
control "LLM generation" as LLM
database "Semantic cache" as Cache
database "Interaction store" as Store
Route -> Route : redact PII; verify CSRF; input check
Route -> Cache : lookup only for eligible query
alt cache hit
  Cache --> Route : saved answer + evidence
else cache miss / ineligible
  Route -> RAG : approved question
  RAG -> Retriever : configured retrieval
  Retriever --> RAG : evidence + diagnostics
  opt V3 expansion required
    RAG -> Retriever : load source; verify content hash
    Retriever --> RAG : expanded evidence or skip status
  end
  alt no suitable evidence
    RAG --> Route : no-evidence response
  else evidence available
    RAG -> LLM : bounded context + prompt
    LLM --> RAG : answer + metadata
    RAG --> Route : answer + context + latency
  end
end
Route -> Route : output check; redact PII
Route -> Store : persist status, response, metrics, trace
Route --> Route : return chat_message.html
note over Route,Cache
Semantic cache is bypassed when the
input guardrail is enabled and for
ineligible queries.
end note
@enduml
